  "title": "Usermin version 2.510 released",
  "summary": "Howdy all, We’ve rolled out Usermin version 2.510 to all Virtualmin repos. Changes since 2.500: Update the Authentic theme to the latest version with various improvements and fixes: Add a range slider to adjust content page margins more precisely Add an option to enable rounded corners for content page Add more customization options for pie charts Fix to increase clickable area for checkboxes in File Manager Fix to correct rotation of pin and unpin button for right side slider Fix color of ...",
